rem Digit Power Sum
rem https://projecteuler.net/problem=119
rem Find the Nth number, of two or more
rem digits, that is a power of its digit
rem sum

use numbers
use sequences
use io
use cli

option Nth integer = 30
option Digits integer = 16

rem Below 10^Digits the digit sum is at
rem most 9 * Digits. Try each base up to
rem that and each power under the bound.
Top = Digits * 9
Rows = Top - 1
Base = (2 to Top array) reshape Rows 1
Exps = 2 to (Digits * 4) array
Pow = Base ** Exps
Limit = 10 ** Digits
Fit = Pow less Limit
Fit and= Pow at least 10
Safe = Fit choose Pow 0
Place = array shape Digits fill 10
Ds = Safe Place digits
Sums = Ds sum axis 0
Hit = Fit and Sums equal Base
Found = Pow filter Hit array
Sorted = Found sort
Answer = Sorted (Nth - 1)
Answer print
